        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Languages: Pashto\n- People: Pashtuns\n- Communities: Pashtun diaspora\n- Places: Pakistan, Jalalabad, Afghanistan, Adinapur\n- Historical Figures: Hsüan-tsang\n\nFacts:\n- In the 7th century, Hsüan-tsang documented Jalalabad under its former name Adinapur.\n- Jalalabad is a city in eastern Afghanistan.\n- Pakistan is home to the largest Pashtun community.\n- Pashto is the main language among the Pashtun diaspora around the world.",
